{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54435","headline":"寄颢源上人 · 崔致远","name":"寄颢源上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日低头弄笔端，从人杜口话心难。\n远离尘世虽堪喜，争奈风情未肯阑。\n影鬬晴霞红叶径，声连夜雨白云湍。\n吟魂对景无羇绊，四海深机忆道安。\n（《新增东国舆地胜览》卷三十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}